    "url": "https://www.oliverwyman.com/our-expertise/insights/2025/oct/how-to-revive-aircraft-supply-chains-to-accelerate-delivery.html",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "17,000 Aircraft on Backlog: Aviation's Supply Chain Crisis - International Fastener Expo",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "17,000 Aircraft on Backlog: Aviation’s Supply Chain Crisis",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Engine supply constraints are forcing airlines to extend fleet lifecycles and push global MRO spending toward $193 billion by 2036, according to Oliver Wyman’s 2026-2036 forecast.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Aircraft backlogs exceed 17,000 units as casting and forging delays sideline more than 3,500 engines awaiting critical components, costing the industry more than $11 billion in 2025 alone.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Head to the airport today, and it would be hard to tell there’s a shortage of anything other than air traffic controllers. However, internationally the supply chain is tightening.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Aircraft sit without engines. Overhaul queues stretch for months. The global backlog of commercial aircraft has topped 17,000 units, the equivalent of roughly 12 years of current production, and the binding constraint isn’t airframes. It’s engines.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "The Engine Shortage That Grounded Expectations",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "significantly accelerated the backlog, pulling hundreds of Airbus A320neo aircraft off the line simultaneously. CFM LEAP engines face their own pressure as shop visits accumulate. The result is completed aircraft parked without engines while airlines absorb costs on both ends.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "The constraint rarely lives at a single stage. Raw material procurement, heat treatment, machining, non-destructive testing, and certification review stack on top of one another. Even one specialized fastener shortage can halt final assembly. That’s the delicacy operators are managing every day.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   },
   {
    "quote": "Structural hurdles, including casting and forging lead times, certified engineer shortages, and raw materials geopolitics, aren’t resolving quickly. Carriers and suppliers that build diversified sourcing strategies, strong aftermarket relationships, and longer planning horizons will be better placed when the cycle turns.",
    "url": "https://fastenershows.com/news/17000-aircraft-on-backlog-aviations-supply-chain-crisis/145609/",
    "pass": 3
   }
